Party Parrot GIFs from https://cultofthepartyparrot.com
(https://github.com/jmhobbs/cultofthepartyparrot.com).

The original parrot GIF is by Geiger Powell, who gave permission for unlimited
use and adaptation. These copies are the Slack / Discord party reactions people
already know:

  celebration.gif  mergedparrot     (merge party)
  ship-it.gif      shipitparrot
  nailed-it.gif    dealwithitparrot
  nice-work.gif    thankyouparrot
  high-five.gif    thumbsupparrot
  cleanup.gif      fixparrot

They live here, in the organisation profile repository, rather than in each
code repository. Every MoleCare code repository refuses binary image files in
CI — a real patient photograph once reached one of them as a base64 blob inside
a source file, past every filename check. Keeping these here means the merge
celebration works everywhere without any repository relaxing that rule.

